<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS7.SSS0.Px3" title="In 5.7 Ablation Study ‣ 5 Analysis ‣ GPAS: Accelerating Convergence of LLM Pretraining via Gradient-Preserving Activation Scaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Necessity of stop gradient operator.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS7.SSS0.Px4" title="In 5.7 Ablation Study ‣ 5 Analysis ‣ GPAS: Accelerating Convergence of LLM Pretraining via Gradient-Preserving Activation Scaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Learnable vs. predefined gate value.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In GPAS: Accelerating Convergence of LLM Pretraining via Gradient-Preserving Activation Scaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Conclusion</span></a>
