<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In 6 Conclusion ‣ GPAS: Accelerating Convergence of LLM Pretraining via Gradient-Preserving Activation Scaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Broader Impact.</span></a></li>
